Poland registry-first corpus

Source: Główny Urząd Geodezji i Kartografii (GUGiK), Państwowy Rejestr Granic
(PRG), official national address-point GML export acquired 19 October 2026.
https://www.geoportal.gov.pl/pl/dane/panstwowy-rejestr-granic-prg/
https://opendata.geoportal.gov.pl/prg/adresy/PRG-punkty_adresowe.zip

The official product page states: "Dane PRG są dostępne bezpłatnie i do dowolnego
wykorzystania" (PRG data are available free of charge and for any use).
Geoportal terms, Article 3, permit publication with attribution to the source:
https://www.geoportal.gov.pl/en/about-geoportal/terms-and-conditions/
The evaluator names these source-specific terms GUGiK-PRG-open-data, not CC BY
or a blanket worldwide public-domain dedication.

Native names, numbers, postcodes and projected coordinates are adapted from
source records, with joins through the source GML references. No geocoder's
answers supply expectations. ASCII variants use BSD-3-Clause deunicode.
Sampling, projection, source-ID grouping and limitations:
docs/evaluation/registry/pl.md.
